---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "單人房/雙人房"
permalink: /rooms/
---
<h1>單人房/雙人房</h1>
<p>以下房型來自各病房單位,顯示目前價格、照片與空床狀態。點選「申請」即可填寫資料。</p>

<div class="room-grid">
  {% for photo in rooms.photos %}
  {% if photo.type == "單人房" %}{% set beds = rooms.single_room_beds %}{% endif %}
  {% if photo.type == "雙人房" %}{% set beds = rooms.double_room_beds | flattenRoomBeds %}{% endif %}
  {% set fee = room_fees.list | findByType(photo.type) %}
  {% set available = beds | availableBeds %}
  <div class="room-card" data-room-type="{{ photo.type }}">
    <div class="room-card__image">
      {% if photo.image %}<img src="{{ photo.image }}" alt="{{ photo.type }}照片" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;">{% else %}尚無照片{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="room-card__body">
      <div class="room-card__title-row">
        <span>{{ photo.type }}</span>
        <span>NT$ {{ fee.insured }} / 日</span>
      </div>
      <p class="room-card__fee-note">自費身分:第一日 NT$ {{ fee.self_pay_day1 }}・第二日以後 NT$ {{ fee.self_pay_day2plus }}</p>
      <p>{{ photo.description }}</p>
      {% if available == 0 %}
        <span class="m3-chip m3-chip--error room-card__status">客滿</span>
      {% elif available <= 2 %}
        <span class="m3-chip m3-chip--warning room-card__status">剩 {{ available }} 床</span>
      {% else %}
        <span class="m3-chip m3-chip--success room-card__status">有空房</span>
      {% endif %}

      <button type="button" class="btn btn--tonal room-card__request-btn" data-room-type="{{ photo.type }}" data-beds="{{ rooms | bedLabelsExcluding(photo.type) | dump }}">
        申請{{ photo.type }}
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>病房費用</h2>
<table class="price-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>病房種類</th>
      <th>自費身分・第一日</th>
      <th>自費身分・第二日以後</th>
      <th>健保身分</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for fee in room_fees.list %}
    <tr>
      <td data-label="病房種類">{{ fee.type }}</td>
      <td data-label="自費身分・第一日">NT$ {{ fee.self_pay_day1 }}</td>
      <td data-label="自費身分・第二日以後">NT$ {{ fee.self_pay_day2plus }}</td>
      <td data-label="健保身分">NT$ {{ fee.insured }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<dialog id="room-request-dialog" class="m3-dialog">
  <form id="room-request-form" class="m3-dialog__form" novalidate>
    <div class="m3-dialog__header">
      <span class="m3-dialog__icon material-symbols-outlined" id="dialog-icon" aria-hidden="true">bed</span>
      <h2 class="m3-dialog__title">申請<span id="dialog-room-type"></span></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="m3-dialog__subtitle">請填寫目前床號與病患姓名,送出後護理站將盡快為您安排。</p>

    <div class="m3-field">
      <label for="dialog-bed">目前床號</label>
      <select id="dialog-bed" name="bed-number" class="m3-field__input" required></select>
    </div>
    <div class="m3-field">
      <label for="dialog-name">病患姓名</label>
      <input type="text" id="dialog-name" name="patient-name" class="m3-field__input" required>
    </div>

    <p class="m3-dialog__status" role="status" hidden>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="m3-dialog__status-text"></span>
    </p>

    <div class="m3-dialog__actions">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--text" id="dialog-cancel">取消</button>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn--filled">
        送出申請
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">send</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>
